Hello List,
we are working on an embedded device running on Linux 2.6.24.6.
We had some devices returned from the field with corrupted UBI partitions o=
n a NOR flash.
The corruption was probably caused by a power cut, but we aren't sure about=
 the root cause of the failure.

We found a similar issue in an old thread from the mailing list where Artem=
 said that UBI on NOR could have some bugs that can lead to such a failure =
(http://lists.infradead.org/pipermail/linux-mtd/2009-May/025737.html), but =
no final statements was given on that thread.

Any help would be appreciated, thank you.


